WEBVTT

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:08.610
<b>Meiji Tokyo Renka</b>

00:01:36.410 --> 00:01:38.360
You're Ayazuki Mei-san, right?

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:41.830
<i>That was...</i>

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:46.080
Apparently, that girl can see ghosts.

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:47.340
Huh? Really?

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:49.160
She's even friends with them.

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:51.210
That's so weird.

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:53.080
Right?

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:54.290
Totally.

00:01:56.440 --> 00:01:57.610
<i>This is...</i>

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:01.210
What is it?

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:06.140
<i>The world I used to live in...</i>

00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:12.760
<i>I'll be going back there soon.</i>

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:48.450
<i>Mei...</i>

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:51.920
<i>Why do you gaze at the moon?</i>

00:02:53.410 --> 00:02:59.200
<i>Will you soon be leaving my side?</i>

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:02.260
<i>Mei...</i>

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:07.480
<i>I will...</i>

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:14.730
<i>finish writing this story for you.</i>

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:22.180
<i>No... It will be for me, so that I will 
finally be able to face you properly.</i>

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:22.180
The Dancing Girl

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:45.870
<i>There will be a full moon soon.</i>

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:53.570
<i>And I will go back to my time.</i>

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:58.020
<i>That's what I wanted at first, too.</i>

00:04:00.980 --> 00:04:04.000
<i>But things have changed...</i>

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:11.750
I want to stay here, forever.

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:13.970
By Ougai-san's side.

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:17.330
Then stay. Stay as long as you like.

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:19.810
I want to stay!

00:04:19.810 --> 00:04:23.180
I want to stay with Ougai-san forever!

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:33.210
<b>Meiji Tokyo Renka</b>

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:52.020
<b>Ougai's 
Study</b>

00:05:01.020 --> 00:05:02.290
What?

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:04.150
Oh, nothing.

00:05:08.020 --> 00:05:11.270
G-Good night.

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:14.830
Yes, good night.

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:26.430
<b>Ougai's Study</b>

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:34.600
I haven't seen Ougai-san at all today.

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:50.950
<b>Labyrinth of Love
and Heartache</b>

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:00.300
Six o'clock...

00:06:00.820 --> 00:06:04.220
Ougai-san's bath time!

00:06:04.970 --> 00:06:06.830
If I go to the sun room now,

00:06:06.830 --> 00:06:09.400
I'll be able to catch Ougai-san 
while he's bath—

00:06:11.230 --> 00:06:13.120
That's not right, is it?

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:36.610
I at least want to say good morning to him.

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:41.900
What?

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:45.020
Good morning.

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:46.630
Morning.

00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:52.400
Good morning.

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:54.250
Good morning.

00:06:54.860 --> 00:06:57.170
What's with you lately?

00:06:57.170 --> 00:06:59.650
Oh, uh, well...

00:07:00.630 --> 00:07:02.140
It's time for breakfast.

00:07:02.140 --> 00:07:04.150
O-Okay!

00:07:13.980 --> 00:07:15.250
What is it?

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:20.570
Oh, I was just wondering 
if Ougai-san was coming.

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:22.040
He should be here soon.

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:24.030
Right, of course.

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:26.760
Thank you for the food!

00:07:28.790 --> 00:07:30.680
It's so good.

00:07:38.340 --> 00:07:41.860
Ougai-san is pretty late.

00:07:41.860 --> 00:07:43.060
He's probably not coming.

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:43.860
Huh?!

00:07:45.210 --> 00:07:49.320
He seems to be particularly focused 
on his writing at the moment.

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:53.040
He probably just has more to do than usual.

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:54.580
Writing?

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:57.510
You mean a novel?

00:07:57.510 --> 00:07:58.380
Yes.

00:08:02.130 --> 00:08:04.810
So that's why.

00:08:07.940 --> 00:08:09.340
Then...

00:08:11.350 --> 00:08:15.970
D-Do you think there's something 
I can do to help him?

00:08:17.230 --> 00:08:18.890
Of course not.

00:08:22.190 --> 00:08:23.740
Ougai-san!

00:08:25.090 --> 00:08:26.950
Well, good morning.

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:28.610
Syunso.

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:29.730
Little Squirrel.

00:08:31.680 --> 00:08:34.740
G-Good morning!

00:08:36.520 --> 00:08:39.570
G-Good morning.

00:08:40.480 --> 00:08:45.130
So! Y-You're writing a novel, Ougai-san?

00:08:51.740 --> 00:08:54.920
Fumi-san! Another serving 
of hot miso soup please!

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:56.140
All right.

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:04.470
Yup.

00:09:05.950 --> 00:09:07.890
What kind of story is it?

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:11.620
It is...

00:09:11.620 --> 00:09:12.410
Yes?

00:09:13.510 --> 00:09:15.400
A romance novel.

00:09:17.210 --> 00:09:19.670
Ooh, a love story!

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:21.960
Yes, a love story.

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:24.430
How wonderful!

00:09:24.740 --> 00:09:28.660
I'm really looking forward 
to your romance novel!

00:09:29.870 --> 00:09:31.650
I wonder what it'll be about.

00:09:31.650 --> 00:09:33.910
Will there be a big 
encounter at a street corner?

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:35.050
What's that mean?

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:38.300
A big encounter... That would be nice.

00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:41.090
You really think so?

00:09:41.090 --> 00:09:41.850
Yes.

00:09:49.530 --> 00:09:53.450
I'll be making good progress 
thanks to you, Little Squirrel.

00:10:01.310 --> 00:10:04.200
I hope I was helpful.

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:07.680
Seems like it.

00:10:38.970 --> 00:10:43.350
And so the lovers will probably be reunited

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:48.080
when he's transferred into the 
same class as her, right?

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:49.120
Pardon?

00:10:49.850 --> 00:10:54.960
"Let's see... Your desk is the one next 
to hers," or something like that.

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:56.270
Okay...?

00:10:56.270 --> 00:10:59.940
"He doesn't have the textbooks yet,
so share yours with him."

00:10:59.940 --> 00:11:03.270
And that's where their love will start!

00:11:06.150 --> 00:11:10.400
Umm... that sounds nice.

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:12.150
Doesn't it though?

00:11:13.510 --> 00:11:14.400
But...

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:18.920
That means Ougai-san is going to 
shut himself up in that room again.

00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:22.010
Yes, he must be really focused.

00:11:22.010 --> 00:11:23.660
For hours on end.

00:11:24.390 --> 00:11:27.080
How long do you think it'll take him?

00:11:27.470 --> 00:11:29.540
Till next week?

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:30.950
I'm not sure.

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:33.140
Will it be the week after that, maybe?

00:11:33.140 --> 00:11:35.550
Hopefully he will be done soon.

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:48.520
Shhh! Doggies, shhh!

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:55.100
Ougai-san is focusing on his work 
right now, so please bark softly.

00:11:59.410 --> 00:12:00.290
Huh?

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:18.610
He's bathing?

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:27.940
Ougai-san's bath time is...

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:33.640
My schedule is such that I bathe each day,
 morning and evening, at six o'clock.

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:35.730
Isn't it?

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:38.230
<b>Midday
 Cannon</b>

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:41.240
<b>Midday 
Cannon</b>

00:12:39.220 --> 00:12:40.980
Shhh!

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:41.240
<b>Shhh!</b>

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:45.630
It's only noon, though.

00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:00.750
<b>Bang, Bang, Bang, Bang, Bang, Bang</b>

00:12:59.030 --> 00:13:00.770
Now what?!

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:03.170
Hello there!

00:13:04.330 --> 00:13:07.080
S-Someone making a challenge?

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:11.960
Pardon the intrusion!

00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:16.270
E-Excuse me, wh—

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:17.930
It's fine, it's fine.

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:19.490
Is Mori-kun at home?

00:13:19.490 --> 00:13:23.730
His sworn ally, Okakura Tenshin, 
has come with a gift to show support.

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:29.620
Sensei!

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:30.730
Sensei?

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:33.450
Hishida-kun, where might Mori-kun be?

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:34.600
The study?

00:13:34.600 --> 00:13:35.840
Where is the study?

00:13:35.840 --> 00:13:38.220
Here? Mori-kun! Not here.

00:13:38.220 --> 00:13:40.760
Here, maybe? Mori-kun! Not here, either.

00:13:40.760 --> 00:13:43.770
Mori-kun! Hey, Mori-kun!

00:13:44.270 --> 00:13:45.790
E-Excuse me!

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:49.350
Please be quiet. Ougai-san 
is currently writing.

00:13:49.350 --> 00:13:51.500
What? What was that?!

00:13:53.270 --> 00:13:55.640
He's writing? Is it <i>that</i> piece?!

00:13:56.030 --> 00:13:59.390
Has he finally started working 
on that romance novel?!

00:13:59.390 --> 00:14:01.650
Yes... Are you familiar with it?

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:03.400
Of course!

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:07.710
It is the story of a young man who travels 
to a foreign land and meets a beautiful woman,

00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:10.140
and they fall in love at first sight.

00:14:10.140 --> 00:14:12.660
It's that passionate a story?

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:15.540
A-And what about a big explosive encounter?

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:17.520
That's right.

00:14:17.520 --> 00:14:20.770
Dazzling days of splendid love that go bang!

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:26.210
But a cruel destiny will soon strike 
them like a bolt of lightning, ba-boom!

00:14:27.540 --> 00:14:30.400
And two people in love are torn apart!

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:32.300
What? No way!

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:35.370
Eventually, as the man returns 
home to Japan on a ship,

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:40.080
he sheds a single tear as he thinks 
about the woman he left behind.

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:42.050
An unexpectedly tragic love story!

00:14:42.050 --> 00:14:44.640
A man who chose his country over love!

00:14:44.640 --> 00:14:46.460
A woman left behind all alone!

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:48.020
Oh, Mori-kun!

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:51.410
How will you depict those 
emotions, Mori-kun?

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:52.830
E-Excuse me!

00:14:55.860 --> 00:14:57.080
Ougai-san!

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:59.860
Well now, there you are, Mori-kun!

00:14:59.860 --> 00:15:02.470
Is writing going well? 
I brought you sweet buns!

00:15:02.470 --> 00:15:04.300
I have high expectations, Mori-kun!

00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:06.440
Of a story that makes my 
blood boil with passion!

00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:09.090
A bittersweet, tearjerker of a love story!

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:11.160
Write your heart out!

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:14.720
When will you be finished? Next week? 
Or the week after that?

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:17.580
Sensei, let's just leave it at that...

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:18.970
Oh, Hishida-kun!

00:15:19.380 --> 00:15:21.460
How is that painting going?

00:15:21.460 --> 00:15:22.980
Have you painted that black cat?

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:24.830
How are your eyes?

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:25.580
Well...

00:15:25.580 --> 00:15:28.970
Not yet? Okay, then! Hurry up 
and paint it, lickity-split!

00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:30.830
I have huge expectations for you!

00:15:30.830 --> 00:15:33.660
When will it be finished? Next week? 
The week after that?

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:35.360
About that...

00:15:36.440 --> 00:15:38.390
Well then, I will come by 
again the week after next.

00:15:38.390 --> 00:15:39.240
Thank you for having me.

00:15:41.690 --> 00:15:44.130
Umm... who was that?

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:45.920
My art teacher.

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:47.030
My drinking buddy.

00:15:47.030 --> 00:15:49.250
He's not a bad person, deep down.

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:50.640
Okay...

00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:54.630
Where are you going, Ougai-san?

00:15:56.170 --> 00:15:58.480
I thought I would bathe myself.

00:15:58.480 --> 00:16:01.120
Huh? Didn't you just do that?

00:16:06.340 --> 00:16:08.890
Oh, I guess I did.

00:16:09.410 --> 00:16:10.320
Well, then.

00:16:13.290 --> 00:16:15.310
Thank you, Little Squirrel.

00:16:17.590 --> 00:16:19.410
Oh, sure.

00:16:21.940 --> 00:16:22.380
I-...

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:26.870
I wish you luck.

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:40.240
What's wrong with me? What am I doing?

00:16:47.010 --> 00:16:49.690
I don't want to bother 
him while he's writing,

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:53.020
but I just want to be with him for a bit.

00:16:56.180 --> 00:17:00.230
<i>The moon will be full soon.</i>

00:17:00.940 --> 00:17:08.000
<i>I want to spend as much 
time with him as I can until then.</i>

00:17:21.760 --> 00:17:23.980
'Ello, Mei-chan. Good even—

00:17:27.490 --> 00:17:29.310
Ouchie...

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:29.970
Huh?

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:33.980
C-Charlie-san! I'm so sorry.

00:17:34.410 --> 00:17:36.110
No worries, no worries!

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:41.490
In fact, I wouldn't mind at all if you 
hit and kicked me while cursing at me.

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:42.660
Pervert!

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:44.160
Oh, sorry.

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:45.490
Totally fine!

00:17:45.810 --> 00:17:49.590
What are you doing here, anyway?

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:54.630
I just had a feeling you 
might want to talk to me.

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:55.260
Huh?

00:17:55.650 --> 00:17:59.260
It's not much longer, Mei-chan, 
till the full moon.

00:18:01.030 --> 00:18:03.450
I've kept you waiting 
quite a while, haven't I?

00:18:03.450 --> 00:18:07.260
Ah, but you just need to 
be patient a little longer.

00:18:07.260 --> 00:18:10.620
Once there's a full moon,
 I will finally send you back

00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:15.520
to your time in a flash, just as you wished!

00:18:19.670 --> 00:18:20.720
Eh?

00:18:20.720 --> 00:18:22.470
What's the matter, Mei-chan?

00:18:23.390 --> 00:18:25.540
Umm... Charlie-san?

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:26.270
Hm?

00:18:27.300 --> 00:18:29.980
I don't want to go back.

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:32.280
Huh?

00:18:33.780 --> 00:18:35.280
Wha—?!

00:18:35.790 --> 00:18:37.050
I don't want to go back!

00:18:40.650 --> 00:18:46.070
Even I didn't expect that 
I would feel this way.

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:52.550
But I... I want to stay with 
Ougai-san much, much longer!

00:18:52.970 --> 00:18:56.430
I want to stay with Ougai-san!

00:18:59.640 --> 00:19:04.570
T-That's quite unexpected!

00:19:04.570 --> 00:19:11.020
Oh my, I never would have even 
imagined you would say such a thing.

00:19:11.020 --> 00:19:12.590
I'm sorry...

00:19:12.590 --> 00:19:14.630
This is unexpected.

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:16.100
Unexpected, but...

00:19:16.570 --> 00:19:18.140
In that case...

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:21.300
Why don't you stay?

00:19:26.590 --> 00:19:27.350
Huh?

00:19:28.130 --> 00:19:31.840
If that's what you really want to do, 
then you should stay.

00:19:32.250 --> 00:19:34.850
Wha? C-Can I?

00:19:34.850 --> 00:19:35.870
Sure.

00:19:37.030 --> 00:19:41.410
Can I stay here forever?

00:19:42.900 --> 00:19:43.860
Sure.

00:19:44.860 --> 00:19:46.870
Really?

00:19:47.250 --> 00:19:48.160
Yes.

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:49.640
Truly?

00:19:49.640 --> 00:19:50.770
Truly.

00:19:50.770 --> 00:19:52.680
Really and truly?

00:19:52.680 --> 00:19:55.160
Yes, really and truly.

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:57.370
I'll stay, then!

00:19:57.720 --> 00:19:59.990
I will stay here!

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:09.010
Mei-chan, it's a good thing 
you met Ougai-san, isn't it?

00:20:09.010 --> 00:20:12.270
Yes, it really is.

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:15.900
And now I can stay with 
Ougai-san forever, can't I?

00:20:16.240 --> 00:20:18.230
Yes, you can.

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:20.280
But!

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:24.400
Feel free to tell me if you ever 
change your mind, Mei-chan.

00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:25.740
I won't!

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:28.050
I have no doubts. I'll be fine!

00:20:28.050 --> 00:20:29.660
Thank you, Charlie-san!

00:20:30.880 --> 00:20:32.420
You're welcome.

00:20:32.420 --> 00:20:34.130
Instead of thanking me,

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:37.930
I wouldn't mind if you gave me a 
swift kick or slapped me again.

00:20:37.930 --> 00:20:40.460
You're such a creep, Charlie-san!

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:45.050
Well then, Mei-chan, sweet dreams.

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:03.480
What a strange person Charlie-san is.

00:21:10.150 --> 00:21:11.080
Mei...

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:18.370
<i>Why do you gaze 
at the moon?</i>

00:21:20.760 --> 00:21:23.690
<i>When the moon becomes full again,</i>

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:29.330
<i>will you disappear before my eyes?</i>

00:21:30.070 --> 00:21:36.030
<i>Just as you suddenly appeared before 
me on that night of the full moon,</i>

00:21:37.250 --> 00:21:38.940
<i>will you suddenly...</i>

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:43.060
<i>Mei...</i>

00:21:44.240 --> 00:21:48.300
<i>I will finish writing this story.</i>

00:21:49.300 --> 00:21:51.590
<i>In order to face myself.</i>

00:21:51.580 --> 00:21:55.080
<b>The Dancing Girl</b>

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:55.080
<i>Before you suddenly vanish...</i>

00:21:55.620 --> 00:21:58.120
<i>Mei, I...</i>

00:22:27.070 --> 00:22:28.280
<i>Elise...</i>

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:40.000
<b>Meiji Tokyo Renka</b>

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:40.000
Next Episode Preview

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:40.000
Escaping at 3 O'Clock
in the Afternoon

00:23:30.750 --> 00:23:32.710
It doesn't matter.

00:23:32.710 --> 00:23:35.130
Not if I can't face my past or my present.

00:23:35.960 --> 00:23:39.440
I love you even when 
you're upset, Ougai-san.
